          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================ -->
  <!-- FEATURES GRID (white bg) -->
  <!-- ============================================ -->
  <section class="bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-50 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-80 h-80 bg-indigo-50 rounded-full blur-3xl translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-28 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[#1e40af] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
          Mengapa Memilih Kami
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#111c2d]" style="letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Keunggulan SDIT Al-Hidayah</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748b] mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Kami memadukan pendidikan akademik berstandar nasional dengan pembinaan karakter Islami yang komprehensif.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="group bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] hover:border-[#1e40af]/20 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-100 to-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#1e40af]" style="font-size:28px;">mosque</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#111c2d] mb-2">Integrasi Islam & Akademik</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed">Kurikulum terpadu yang menggabungkan pembelajaran akademik dengan nilai-nilai Islam dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="group bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] hover:border-indigo-200 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 to-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#4f46e5]" style="font-size:28px;">psychology</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#111c2d] mb-2">Pembelajaran Bermakna</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed">Metode pembelajaran aktif dan berbasis proyek yang mendorong siswa berpikir kritis dan kreatif.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="group bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#059669]" style="font-size:28px;">diversity_1</span>
